# The submission build carries faculty e-mail addresses and the biosketches; it goes to the AIDaS office,
# never into git (root CLAUDE.md rule 12). The patterns also catch a contacts file or a biosketch dropped here
# instead of in latex/, and a PDF downloaded from Overleaf under another name.
AIDaS_SEED_2027_submission.pdf
*submission*.pdf
contacts.tex
[Bb]iosketch*.pdf
# The Overleaf zip (make_overleaf_zip.sh) carries the contacts and the biosketches too.
*.zip
